Body:
Hi — I'd independently opened #34564 for the same fix before I saw this one; closing mine in favor of yours since you were here first. A few things from my version that might be worth folding in:

1. A regression test fits cleanly in `packages/opencode/test/provider/model-status.test.ts`:

```ts
test("accepts embedding modality in configured provider models", () => {
  expect(
    Schema.decodeUnknownSync(ConfigProviderV1.Model)({
      modalities: { output: ["embedding"] },
    }).modalities?.output,
  ).toEqual(["embedding"])
})
```

2. The crash in #34472 is purely in the config/plugin path — the live models.dev API never emits `embedding` — so the `provider.ts` change alone covers it (the extra `models-dev.ts` change is harmless either way).

3. The modality union also flows into `packages/sdk/openapi.json` and `packages/sdk/js/src/v2/gen/types.gen.ts`, so running `./script/generate.ts` keeps the SDK types in sync.

Thanks for taking this!
